          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP721 Old Macleod Trail [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I’m getting slightly better at finding suspect divots, but even many “easy” caps are not gimmes, especially by oneself in long grass. TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
