          <groundspeak:finder id="5323897">brendan714</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP721 Old Macleod Trail

N 50° 43.682 W 113° 58.881&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Near the western end of our bike ride in Okotoks, hunthikers and I stopped by to find this cap after finding a nearby cache.  This cap took quite a while for us to find, and it took careful lining up of previous spoiler photos before we [FOUND] it hidden in the grass!  TFTcap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
